    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1064-a14">

                <pb facs="1157" n="1061" xml:id="pg1061"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 14 in No. 267.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-17"><hi rendition="#italic">February 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>The First Lord of the Admiralty requests me to express Admiralty’s and his
                    personal sympathy with our Government and Navy in the loss of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maine</hi>. Various members of the diplomatic body have
                    called, including the Spanish ambassador.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
